@startuml
title Online Quiz System State Diagram

[*] --> LoggedIn

state LoggedIn
state Teacher
state Student
state QuizCreation
state QuizEditing
state QuizPosted
state QuizResultsViewed
state QuizSelected
state AnsweringQuiz
state QuizSubmitted
state QuizResultViewed

LoggedIn --> Teacher : continue as teacher
LoggedIn --> Student : continue as student

Teacher --> QuizCreation : create quiz
Teacher --> QuizEditing : edit quiz
QuizCreation --> Teacher : save draft
QuizCreation --> QuizPosted : post quiz
QuizEditing --> Teacher : save draft
QuizEditing --> QuizPosted : post quiz

QuizPosted --> [*]

Teacher --> QuizResultsViewed : view results

Student --> QuizSelected : select quiz
QuizSelected --> AnsweringQuiz : answer
AnsweringQuiz --> QuizSubmitted : submit quiz
QuizSubmitted --> QuizResultViewed : view result
QuizResultViewed --> [*]
@enduml
